  "title": "Apyx Medical Corporation To Release First Quarter Of Fiscal Year 2026 Financial Results On May 7, 2026",
  "summary": "CLEARWATER, FL — April 23, 2026 - Apyx® Medical Corporation (NASDAQ:APYX) (the “Company” or “Apyx Medical”), the leader in surgical aesthetics marketed and sold as Renuvion® and the AYON Body Contouring System™ (AYON), today announced that its financial results for the first quarter of fiscal year 2026 will be released before markets open on Thursday, May [...] The post Apyx Medical Corporation To Release First Quarter Of Fiscal Year 2026 Financial Results On May 7, 2026 appeared first on Apyx Medical .",
